Third-party notices for nes.min.css
===================================

This file preserves the licenses of NES.css and the Bootstrap Reboot /
Normalize.css code included in the stylesheet. These copyrights are separate
from Steve Seguin's original example code.

The NES.css header identifies its version as "development"; an exact release
is not recorded in this checkout. The NES.css license reference below is
versioned for provenance, not a claim that the bundle is that exact release.

